			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 761170301,
					"content": "Okay, okay, you win!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kaleva"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170303,
					"content": "See? If you'd just played along earlier, you wouldn't have ended up in this mess. Now, take the Mora and go find yourself a decent doctor.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170304,
					"content": "Hmph, is this your way of showing pity?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kaleva"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170305,
					"content": "Save your breath and just take the Mora. If you'd rather chuck it in the water or hire thugs to jump me, that's your call.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170306,
					"content": "One thing's for sure, though — going hungry and getting beaten up both suck. Don't make things worse for yourself, Kaleva.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170307,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kaleva"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170308,
					"content": "The junk I snatched from that invalid is lying over there.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kaleva"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170309,
					"content": "Aside from some spare change, it was just a painting and some busted doll. The Mora's long gone, but I haven't had time to toss the rest out yet.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kaleva"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170310,
					"content": "Alright, final question. You referred to Ihanti as an \"invalid\" just now. What was that supposed to mean?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170311,
					"content": "It means exactly what it means. That weakling's in such a state now, you can barely tell he's still alive.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kaleva"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170312,
					"content": "When I first found him, he was lying there stiff as a board. I honestly thought he'd already... Y'know...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kaleva"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170313,
					"content": "...Anyway, figured he didn't need his bag any longer, so I snagged it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kaleva"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170314,
					"content": "Mark out the spot where you last saw him.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170315,
					"content": "Where I last saw him? Guess it was about... here.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kaleva"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170316,
					"content": "#Alright. {NICKNAME}, Paimon, let's go.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170317,
					"content": "I'd like to return this stuff to the client in person.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7611704,
