				{
					"id": 761170502,
					"content": "Is everything okay, Miss Jahoda? You seem a little pale... You didn't run into any trouble, did you?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Katheryne"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170503,
					"content": "Don't worry, I'm fine.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170504,
					"content": "Very well then. One moment, I'll be back with your payment right away.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Katheryne"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170505,
					"content": "Are you really okay, Jahoda?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170506
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761170506,
					"content": "Paimon knows we promised not to call a doctor, but... Ihanti really did look awful back there. Maybe we should—",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170507,
					"content": "No. I said I'd stick to the code, so that's what I'll do.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170508,
					"content": "So... you two know each other well?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170509
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761170509,
					"content": "We used to be \"colleagues.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170510,
					"content": "Coward he may be, but when it came to raking in the Mora... hehe, Ihanti was top shelf.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170511,
					"content": "While everyone else was out there pulling dumb scams and petty robberies, he played the game so well that people would end up willingly coughing up the cash.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170512,
					"content": "He had a real knack for talking people into things. Back when we were \"working\" together, he shared a lot of his skills with me... he was always taking me out for great meals, too.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170513,
					"content": "Do you consider him a friend?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170514
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761170514,
					"content": "A friend? Hah, 'course not. You'd have to be crazy to try making friends in that hellhole. At best, we... knew each other.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170515,
					"content": "The only reason he took such good care of me was to show off. Dragging a little sidekick along made him feel like a big shot, I guess.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170516
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170516,
					"content": "But he did look after me, I'll give him that. Helping him now is just me returning the favor.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170517,
					"content": "Alright... Here's your payment, Miss Jahoda. The Adventurers' Guild thanks you for your support!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170518
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Katheryne"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170518,
					"content": "#Here's your share, {NICKNAME}. Thanks for the help back there.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170519
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170519,
					"content": "Anyway, I should head back to the Curatorium. If the Boss wants something done and I'm not there, she'll be on my case again for sure.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170520
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170520,
					"content": "(I did say I wouldn't get him a doctor, but what's the harm in grabbing him some painkillers?)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170521
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170521,
					"content": "(I'll ask the Boss to help, I'm sure she can pull some strings. Worst case scenario, I'll give up this month's pay... Actually, maybe just half of it...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170522
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170522,
					"content": "(Yeah, I'll do that. I'd better get the medicine to Ihanti tomorrow...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				}
			]
		},
